        {
            "id": 11783,
            "question_id": 23738,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Лексична основа: run — бігати / працювати про механізм. Умова описує процес до минулого моменту, а не лише завершений результат. Збережи причину, протиставлення або часовий зв’язок, названі в умові.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11784,
            "question_id": 23738,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the main-clause subject; do not move time or reason phrases to the front. Explain why silence seemed unusual after uninterrupted earlier machine operation.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 11785,
            "question_id": 23738,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: run. Describe the process leading up to a past point, not merely a finished result. Preserve the stated cause, contrast or time relation.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:11.000000Z"
        },
        {
